    <article>
      <h3>
        Software Developer, ICE Mortgage Technology (formerly Simplifile) <span
          >Jan 2019 – Jan 2022</span
        >
      </h3>
      <p>Provo, Utah</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Built and sped up features in Simplifile’s e-recording app for county
